class TestManager
{
  run() {
    please run the following checks, if any one of the check does not pass, return false, if they all passed, return true 

    checks {
      examine the code at {AppSpec.app_entrypoint} {
        - it should use Config.local_llm to send prompt
        - check if the details in Config.local_llm are reflected in {AppSpec.app_entrypoint}
        - after entering a book url and press enter key, a message "Loading..." should appear in div.book_content, the background of the holder of the message should be the same as the background of div.book_content
      }

      use puppeteer to test the web UI, enter the book url: "https://www.gutenberg.org/cache/epub/100/pg100.txt" and press enter key {
        examine div.book_content, it should contain only text, not html
        after button "Convert to Simple English" is clicked {
          the corresponding modal should contain the simple english content of the related paragraph
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
